# VHS tape for checkbox alignment demo

Output examples/vhs/checkbox_alignment_demo.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "clear && cargo run --release --example checkbox_alignment"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

# Show the demo running
Sleep 3s

# Quit the demo
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
